            "id": 80281,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"wrong_answer\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;That's incorrect!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A palavra-chave <code>return</code> vem após o valor de retorno</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não há nada de errado com este código</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Um valor de string não pode ser retornado sem estar em uma variável</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A palavra-chave <code>return</code> vem após o valor de retorno.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual linha deve substituir a linha indentada da função para que ela retorne a string?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"wrong_answer\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;That's incorrect!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return \"That's incorrect!\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"That's incorrect!\" return</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"That's incorrect!\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return \"That's incorrect!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
