            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item_1, item_2, item_3, item_4, item_5)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = item_1 + item_2 + item_3 + item_4 + item_5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cart = get_total(\" /><text value=\"5.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"74.5\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Não há nada de errado com o código</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_total</code> não é um nome de função</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A função não tem uma declaração <code>return</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Não há nada de errado com o código.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que este código exibe <code>74.5</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item_1, item_2, item_3, item_4, item_5)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = item_1 + item_2 + item_3 + item_4 + item_5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cart = get_total(\" /><text value=\"5.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"74.5\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A função soma os cinco valores de argumento e retorna o total para <code>cart</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A função ignora <code>5.5</code> porque ele não é um inteiro.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A função exibe o total sem retornar nenhum valor.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A função soma os cinco valores de argumento e retorna o total para <code>cart</code>.</p></body></html>"
