            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"retrieve_score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(retrieve_score())\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>200</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100 + 100</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não exibirá nada no console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que o console mostra <code>200</code> em vez de <code>100 + 100</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"retrieve_score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(retrieve_score())\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A função calcula a adição, retorna <code>200</code>, e <code>print()</code> o exibe.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A função retorna os caracteres <code>100 + 100</code> sem calculá-los.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Um valor retornado não pode ser usado dentro de <code>print()</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A função calcula a adição, retorna <code>200</code>, e <code>print()</code> o exibe.</p></body></html>"
